span></a><a class=\"popularcard\" href=\"/uk/life/pro-rata-rent\"><span class=\"toolicon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 11 9-8 9 8M5 10v11h14V10M9 21v-7h6v7\"></path></svg></span><h3>Pro-rata rent</h3><p>Rent for a part month when you move in or out.</p><span class=\"openlabel\">Open calculator</span></a><a class=\"popularcard\" href=\"/uk/students/maintenance-loan\"><span class=\"toolicon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m2 8 10-5 10 5-10 5-10-5ZM6 10v7q6 5 12 0v-7M22 8v9\"></path></svg></span><h3>Maintenance loan</h3><p>Student support in England by household income.</p><span class=\"openlabel\">Open calculator</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"browse\" id=\"categories\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"headingrow\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">FIND THE RIGHT TOOL</p><h2>Calculators by topic</h2></div><p>Choose a topic. Get a clearer answer.</p></div><nav class=\"categoryjump\" aria-label=\"Jump to category\"><a href=\"#cat-0\">Benefits &amp; family</a><a href=\"#cat-1\">Renting &amp; council tax</a><a href=\"#cat-2\">Students</a></nav><!--GM:CATEGORYGRID--></div></section>"}, {"tag": "footer", "attrs": {}, "html": "<div class=\"wrap footergrid\"><div><a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"SumAtlas home\"><img src=\"/gm/sumatlas-logo-dark-168.webp\" srcset=\"/gm/sumatlas-logo-dark-84.webp 282w, /gm/sumatlas-logo-dark-168.webp 564w, /gm/sumatlas-logo-dark-252.webp 845w\" sizes=\"282px\" width=\"282\" height=\"84\" alt=\"SumAtlas: free calculators, clear answers\"></a><p>Money calculations, made clear.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\"><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/how-we-check\">How we check</a><a href